           "element": "p",
           "innerHTML": "June Ash is an essayist and, for rent-paying reasons, a research editor. Before Devon there was a decade in publishing<sup style=\"color: #3F6B4F; font-weight: 600;\">1</sup>, which is where the affection for margins, footnotes and other apparatus of the page comes from.",
