           "element": "p",
           "innerHTML": "The essays here are monthly, roughly. Each one goes through three drafts and a long walk<sup style=\"color: #3F6B4F; font-weight: 600;\">2</sup> before it earns its number. Nothing is sponsored; the newsletter is free; the notebook remains private.",
           "mobileStyles": {},
